#: kio_smb.cpp:2274 kio_smb.cpp:2325 kio_smb.cpp:2339 kio_smb.cpp:2358
msgid ""
"\n"
"Make sure that the samba package is installed properly on your system."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Gwiriwch fod y pecyn samba wedi'i osod yn gywir ar eich cysawd."

#: kio_smb.cpp:353
msgid ""
"\n"
"There is probably no SMB service running on this host."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Mae'n debyg nad oes gwasanaeth SMB yn rhedeg ar y gwesteiwr yma."

#: kio_smb.cpp:376 kio_smb.cpp:382
msgid ""
"\n"
"Invalid user/password combination."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Cyfuniad enw defnyddiwr/cyfrinair annilys."

#: kio_smb.cpp:415
msgid "Unable to parse response message."
msgstr "Methu dyrannu'r neges ymateb."

#: kio_smb.cpp:568
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Gweinydd"

#: kio_smb.cpp:571
msgid "Workgroup"
msgstr "Grŵp gwaith"

#: kio_smb.cpp:576
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Rhaniad"

#: kio_smb.cpp:765
msgid ""
"To access the shares of a host, use smb://hostname\n"
"To get a list of all hosts use lan:/ or rlan:/ .\n"
"See the KDE Control Center under Network, LANBrowsing for more information."
msgstr ""
"I hygyrchu rhaniadau gwesteiwr, defnyddiwch smb://enwgwesteiwr\n"
"I gael rhestr o bob gwesteiwr defnyddiwch lan:/ neu rlan:/ .\n"
"Gweler y Ganolfan Reoli KDE o dan Rhwydwaith, PoriRhwydwaithLeol am fwy o "
"wybodaeth."

#: kio_smb.cpp:1256
msgid ""
"\n"
"To access the shares of a host, use smb://hostname\n"
